# Defect 391, 2026-10-06: a run of characters the syntax does not have was
# told one message a character, `ключ` four and `$$$` three (`scan.punct`).
# A run of refused characters that can be seen is told once now, in the
# scanner's words, through the spaces between them, so a word in another
# script and an unquoted phrase are one message each; one alone stays one
# (`refused_stretch.hero`). The strings in backticks are the case beside
# this one.

function a_word()
    x = ключ  #~ unexpected_character
    print(x)

function a_run()
    x = 1 $$$ 2  #~ unexpected_character
    print(x)

function through_spaces()
    x = привет мир  #~ unexpected_character
    print(x)

function alone()
    x = 1 $ 2  #~ unexpected_character
    print(x)

function main()
    a_word()
    a_run()
    through_spaces()
    alone()
